# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Recovered WordPress URLs (2026-08-08).
#
# 531 URLs that Google still has indexed were returning 404: the migration kept
# only one of each duplicate WordPress post, and in most pairs it kept the one
# with LESS search history. Together the dead URLs carried 115,338 impressions
# and 3,797 clicks over the last 16 months.
#
# Sources come from the Search Console page dimension (16 months) filtered to
# URLs that answer 404 on the live site; every destination below was verified
# to answer 200. RedirectMatch (anchored) is used instead of Redirect so a rule
# cannot match by prefix and swallow deeper paths.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
